  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7ae3ef60b8eb38a5e58d978297264b4599b7f2c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7ae3ef60b8eb38a5e58d978297264b4599b7f2c\" data-origin-width=\"1190\" data-origin-height=\"890\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>별건 없는데요. 학생들이 링크에 접속해서 신청부문을 [드롭박스]로 선택하면, 부문별로 취합이 되는 시트입니다.<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1st-mJo8-AVUYkwvBMoCHLFyTWEUJTtoO5VkSHd7VFmY/copy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #0070d1;\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1st-mJo8-AVUYkwvBMoCHLFyTWEUJTtoO5VkSHd7VFmY/copy</span></a><br>&#160;<br><b>1. 대회이름 (파란박스) 입력</b><br>&#160;<br><b>2. 인원제한 입력</b><br>&#160;<br><b>3. 명렬입력</b><br>&#160;<br>출력을 원하시면 [출력] 시트 인쇄하시면 되세요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/775e3bc36363b195c6268028959fe1a5845aa3d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/775e3bc36363b195c6268028959fe1a5845aa3d9\" data-origin-width=\"941\" data-origin-height=\"895\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>&#160;<br>아래는 링크는 사용 방법 안내입니다.<br><a href=\"https://ior.ad/88cZ?iframeHash=trysteps-1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://ior.ad/88cZ?iframeHash=trysteps-1</a>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acd7bab7007e7854f6650a5328b779ca919c0f1a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acd7bab7007e7854f6650a5328b779ca919c0f1a\" data-origin-width=\"1530\" data-origin-height=\"792\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>(참고, 신청자수는....아래 첫 열에 수식이 들어가서 1명으로 인식을 하네요...;;; 방법을 못 찾...았으나 여러명 값 들어가면 바르게 카운딩합니다)<br><br>위 오류는 김정식선생님 덕분에 해결되었습니다. 너무 감사드려요. ^---^</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
